      Bestiary0: "Eight tiny lives become a divine crown. Breaking a borrowed dew core cancels its enhancement and increases damage taken by Miroen by 20% for 5 seconds. The eight-petal finale ends with 6 seconds of fatigue, without a health lock."
      Bestiary1: "Mirror, candle, hive and bell stand in judgment. Damage a lit furnace to suppress its pressure; only one furnace can be suppressed each round, interrupting its attacks and increasing damage taken by Velsa by 25% for 6 seconds."
      Bestiary2: "Five realms form five wheels of destiny. Your old path is recorded for 3 seconds and replayed after a 1.2-second warning. Break the knot to cancel the final replay; choose either fate seal to determine the next two laws."
