      Abandoned: "The challenger has left or prerequisites no longer hold. {0} withdraws the covenant."
      Interrupted: "Another boss has interrupted the rite. {0} withdraws the covenant."
      Exposed: "Broken covenant: increased damage taken"
      Round0: "Rite of Eight Lives: read the fixed paths"
      Round1: "Fourfold Judgment: strike a lit furnace"
      Round2: "Five Realms: your old path will replay"
      Final0: "First Bloom: eight petals unfold in order"
      Final1: "Four Realms to Ash: follow the white-edged lane"
      Final2: "The Hour Without Day: five laws in order"
      Choose: "Choose fate: approach a seal to select two laws; timeout selects the nearer seal"
      Recording: "Recording destiny: leave your old path"
      Replay: "Replay imminent: break the knot to cancel the last replay"
      Law0: "Backburn: delayed fire trails"
      Law1: "Machine: committed magnetic rails"
      Law2: "Hunger: locked mouth strikes"
      Law3: "Sun: rings with an opening"
      Law4: "Tide: alternating curtains"
